  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/731",
  "contentHtml": "<p>주사위 학습게임(브루마블)게임을 태블릿용으로 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학기말에 하면 좋을 것 같네요<br><br>최대&#160;8명까지&#160;참여가&#160;가능합니다. <br>태블릿&#160;1대&#160;놓고&#160;4명이&#160;모여&#160;앉아서&#160;게임을&#160;진행하면&#160;됩니다. <br>게임방법은 그냥 간단합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>주사위 던지고 문제 풀고 맞추면 주사위 칸수 만큼 말을 이동하면 됩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/546f00de511d55b9f58a9cc91593b570501ee3d2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/546f00de511d55b9f58a9cc91593b570501ee3d2\" data-origin-width=\"1732\" data-origin-height=\"914\"></div><p><br>주사위&#160;학습게임게임&#160;-&#160;넌센스&#160;퀴즈&#160;-&#160;모든&#160;학년에서&#160;사용가능합니다. <br>그냥&#160;넌센스&#160;퀴즈&#160;푸는&#160;것&#160;만으로도&#160;재미있습니다. <br>아래&#160;링크&#160;접속해서&#160;시도해&#160;보세요</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생들과 바로 사용 하셔도 됩니다.&#160;<br>&#160; <br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame.html</a><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1db4c5aff2ec4b584fc8f7001c6abfbd7ab02b82\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1db4c5aff2ec4b584fc8f7001c6abfbd7ab02b82\" data-origin-width=\"1731\" data-origin-height=\"919\"></div><p><br>2학년&#160;8단원&#160;열과&#160;우리생활&#160;문제로&#160;만든&#160;주사위&#160;학습게임&#160;입니다. <br>제가&#160;수업시간에&#160;쓰려고&#160;만들어&#160;보았습니다. <br><br><a href=\"https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame2_8.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej1.cafe24.com/html5/dicegame/dicegame2_8.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0da90adecd6c01377ee65cd228e23cb21cd339\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a0da90adecd6c01377ee65cd228e23cb21cd339\" data-origin-width=\"1728\" data-origin-height=\"920\"></div><p><br><br>자신만의&#160;문제를&#160;가지고&#160;직접&#160;만들어서&#160;할&#160;수&#160;있는&#160;주사위학습&#160;게임도&#160;만들었는데 <br>조금&#160;더&#160;보완해서&#160;올리도록&#160;하겠습니다.</p><p>---------------</p><p>&#160;</p><p>재과만 16000명 회원 가입기념으로&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>혹시 찬스카드에 들어가면 재미있는 내용이나,</p><p>&#160;</p><p>중학교 과학교과서 다른 단원 문제를 OX나 단답형 형태로 가지고 계신 것 올려 주시면, 단원별로 다 만들어 볼 생각입니다.</p><p>다른 재미있는 내용도 있으면 엑셀형태로 문제 답 형태로 올려 주세요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>중학교 과학교과서는 단원별로 만들어 보면 어떨까 생각중입니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>제안사항 있으시면 올려 주시면 반영하겠습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53c13f76aa0f213d43121dd03504a9e601c9e2c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53c13f76aa0f213d43121dd03504a9e601c9e2c7\" data-origin-width=\"890\" data-origin-height=\"387\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
